<title>JAPAN: Nippon Carbide - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Carbide - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.99		vs	   21.94</p>
<p> Operating	  930    million    vs	  798    million</p>
<p> Current	    883    million    vs	  611    million</p>
<p> Net		  422    million    vs	  294    million</p>
